 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "floor": 0,
   "text": "On the twenty-second of September, one AI lab cut the price of its best model by a fifth.",
   "start": 2.824,
   "end": 9.235,
   "card": [
    "\u221220%",
    "22 SEP 2026 \u00b7 $5 \u2192 $4 PER MILLION INPUT TOKENS"
   ],
   "mark": 4.0,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "floor": 0,
   "text": "About ninety minutes later, its biggest rival launched two new models, at half the price.",
   "start": 9.882,
   "end": 15.706,
   "card": [
    "\u221250%",
    "~90 MIN LATER \u00b7 THE GAP IS SINGLE-SOURCE"
   ],
   "mark": 2.0,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "floor": 0,
   "text": "Two companies. One afternoon. Both went cheaper.",
   "start": 16.941,
   "end": 20.652,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "Here's what's actually going on.",
   "start": 22.588,
   "end": 24.714,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "When a product gets better every few months, customers really compare two things. How good. And how much.",
   "start": 25.412,
   "end": 32.31,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "Nobody can tell how good in an afternoon. Everyone can see the price.",
   "start": 33.176,
   "end": 37.981,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "So price is the signal. And once one lab moves, the other has hours, not weeks.",
   "start": 38.824,
   "end": 44.577,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "floor": 1,
   "text": "Between 2021 and 2024, the same level of AI went from sixty dollars a million tokens, to six cents.",
   "start": 45.176,
   "end": 55.001,
   "card": [
    "1,000\u00d7",
    "$60 \u2192 $0.06 PER MILLION TOKENS \u00b7 2021 \u2192 2024 \u00b7 a16z"
   ],
   "mark": 0.06,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "floor": 2,
   "text": "A million tokens is about seven hundred and fifty thousand words. Roughly eight novels.",
   "start": 56.471,
   "end": 62.906,
   "card": [
    "\u2248 8 NOVELS",
    "1 TOKEN \u2248 \u00be OF A WORD"
   ],
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "floor": 2,
   "text": "At the new cheapest price, a machine can read all eight for less than ten pence.",
   "start": 63.529,
   "end": 68.517,
   "card": [
    "< 10P",
    "$0.10 PER MILLION INPUT TOKENS"
   ],
   "mark": 0.1,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "floor": 2,
   "text": "Your whole reading list. Every review a takeaway has ever had. A year of your emails.",
   "start": 69.176,
   "end": 75.048,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "floor": 3,
   "text": "Biologists have a name for this.",
   "start": 77.647,
   "end": 80.12,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "floor": 3,
   "text": "In Through the Looking-Glass, the Red Queen tells Alice: it takes all the running you can do, to keep in the same place.",
   "start": 80.471,
   "end": 87.916,
   "card": [
    "THE RED QUEEN",
    "LEWIS CARROLL \u00b7 1871"
   ],
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "floor": 3,
   "text": "In 1973, a biologist called Leigh Van Valen borrowed her, to explain why species never get ahead. Their rivals keep evolving too.",
   "start": 88.235,
   "end": 98.865,
   "card": [
    "VAN VALEN",
    "\"A NEW EVOLUTIONARY LAW\" \u00b7 1973"
   ],
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "floor": 3,
   "text": "Two labs, running as fast as they can, to stay exactly where they are. And every step they take, you get it cheaper.",
   "start": 99.529,
   "end": 107.44,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "floor": 4,
   "text": "So imagine the running never stops.",
   "start": 110.824,
   "end": 113.746,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "floor": 4,
   "text": "Not a forecast. A what-if.",
   "start": 119.294,
   "end": 121.562,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": true,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "floor": 4,
   "text": "Imagine the best tutor on Earth costs less than a text message.",
   "start": 122.118,
   "end": 126.712,
   "card": null,
   "mark": -0.001,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "floor": 4,
   "text": "Then the best coder. The best translator. The best second opinion.",
   "start": 127.059,
   "end": 131.601,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "floor": 4,
   "text": "When thinking is almost free, what gets expensive?",
   "start": 132.706,
   "end": 136.057,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": true
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "floor": 4,
   "text": "Maybe the things a machine can't send you. Your time. Your attention. Someone who turns up.",
   "start": 137.647,
   "end": 143.763,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "floor": 5,
   "text": "Tonight's version: find the one job you've been putting off because it means hours of reading, and hand it over for pennies.",
   "start": 146.118,
   "end": 154.16,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": false,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "floor": 5,
   "text": "One lab cut its price by a fifth. The other cut it in half.",
   "start": 156.0,
   "end": 160.184,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "floor": 5,
   "text": "And both of them are still running.",
   "start": 160.941,
   "end": 163.335,
   "card": null,
   "mark": null,
   "cut": true,
   "ladder": false,
   "drop": false,
   "quiet": false
  }
 ]
